---
/** Avatar: a team stacked on a sheet: a photo, two sets of initials and a count, each cut out of the one before it. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet" style="--cover-surface:var(--color-surface-raised); padding:18px 22px">
  <span class="cover-avatars" style="--d:40px">
    <i class="cover-avatar cover-avatar-photo"></i>
    <span class="cover-avatar">AL</span>
    <span class="cover-avatar">JT</span>
    <span class="cover-avatar">+3</span>
  </span>
</span>
